  <!-- EN: Gelatin -->
  <AQGelatin.label>明胶</AQGelatin.label>
  <!-- EN: Gelatin or gelatine (from Latin: gelatus meaning "stiff" or "frozen") is a translucent, colorless, flavorless food ingredient, derived from collagen taken from animal body parts. It is brittle when dry and gummy when moist. It is commonly used as a gelling agent in food. -->
  <AQGelatin.description>明胶或明胶（源自拉丁语：gelatus，意为 "僵硬 "或 "冻结"）是一种半透明、无色、无味的食品配料，由动物身体部位的胶原蛋白提炼而成。干燥时呈脆性，潮湿时呈胶状。它通常用作食品中的胶凝剂。</AQGelatin.description>
